# Browser
# Deadly Cover-Up with evidence collected (CR 701.59a): what Bot1's page says at each question. The additional cost is asked as
# a choice of additional costs; the card exiled from an opponent's graveyard is a card to exile; the rest of its name in that
# graveyard is "any number of cards" to exile (the rules text's own words); and the library searched is Bot2's, whose cards go
# to exile, not Bot1's own into its hand, which is what the search used to say ("search your library ... into your hand").
# Bot2 casts three Ornithopters (all free), so after one is exiled two remain in its graveyard and two are left in its library.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Black Lotus
Deadly Cover-Up
Griselbrand
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x4
Island
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Griselbrand; Swamp)
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Deadly Cover-Up.Cast
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Deadly Cover-Up: choose an additional cost to pay
? Client.Bot1.Dock = Cast without collecting evidence; Collect evidence 6; Cancel
Bot1.Modes(Collect evidence)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Griselbrand)
Bot1.Pass
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Deadly Cover-Up: choose a card to exile
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Deadly Cover-Up: choose any number of cards to exile
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Search Bot2's library
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Detail = Choose any number of cards to exile  ·  0 chosen
Bot1.Search(Ornithopter; Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 5
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 1
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 1
Bot2.Library.Count = 10
Bot2.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island
